text But if we just continue making it with our own two hands, then that won't happen.
sound QUJ.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text And then only the people who can empathize with the music he wants to make himself will buy his music... is what I told him.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's true...
text @[Tomoya]
text Besides, I don't think he'll ever lose sight of his music again.
text @[Tomoya]
text With the person he loves right there beside him...
text @[Tomoya]
text And him being here in the town he loves...
sound QUK.aac
